-- +goose Up
-- The central equipment catalog grows to the common cooking and baking tools
-- (ADR-00024): bakeware by type, knives, hand tools, measuring tools and small
-- appliances. Rendered by genseed -equipment-additions from
-- internal/catalog/seed/equipment_additions.json; the sized flag (ADR-00019) is
-- set on pans, tins and dishes. The statements tolerate rows the application
-- already created: an existing row of the same name is adopted (marked
-- reviewed, its sized flag untouched) and an existing alias is left alone.


-- +goose Down
-- Nothing is removed. Up may have adopted rows that already existed, and recipes
-- may link to the added equipment, so Down cannot tell them from rows it
-- created; an extra reviewed catalog entry is harmless.
SELECT 1;
